  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For a Fedora3 RELS-EXT datastream that was identified as \"RELS-EXT.1\" in the foxml, even though there was only one version of the RELS-EXT content, the migration tool put RELS-EXT in OCFL v2, instead of v1 with the other datastreams. There's only one version of the RELS-EXT, so it can just be in OCFL v1.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here's the relevant foxml:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "<foxml:datastream ID=\"RELS-EXT\" STATE=\"A\" CONTROL_GROUP=\"X\" VERSIONABLE=\"true\">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "      <foxml:datastreamVersion ID=\"RELS-EXT.1\" LABEL=\"External Relations\" CREATED=\"2019-05-09T15:52:01.885Z\" MIMETYPE=\"application/rdf+xml\" FORMAT_URI=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:FedoraRELSExt-1.0\" SIZE=\"318\">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "                <foxml:contentDigest TYPE=\"MD5\" DIGEST=\"870c9172498c0459d45df88b9686c8e8\"/>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "                <foxml:xmlContent>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<rdf:RDF xmlns:fedora-model=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#\" xmlns:rdf=\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/test:233605\">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<fedora-model:hasModel rdf:resource=\"info:fedora/bdr-cmodel:commonMetadata\"></fedora-model:hasModel>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</rdf:Description>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</rdf:RDF>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "               </foxml:xmlContent>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "       </foxml:datastreamVersion>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "</foxml:datastream>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
