       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Ac29953be-a155-407e-b409-91cc485b98eb\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:c29953be-a155-407e-b409-91cc485b98eb\" data-account-id=\"557058:c29953be-a155-407e-b409-91cc485b98eb\" accountid=\"557058:c29953be-a155-407e-b409-91cc485b98eb\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ben_cail</a>, the way that the migration-utils application determines which datastreams should be in a given \"version\" is by using timestamps. All datastream versions that share the same timestamp belong to the same \"version\".<br/>\nSee:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/migration-utils/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/migration/handlers/VersionAbstractionFedoraObjectHandler.java#L80\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/migration-utils/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/migration/handlers/VersionAbstractionFedoraObjectHandler.java#L80</a><br/>\nand:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/migration-utils/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/migration/handlers/VersionAbstractionFedoraObjectHandler.java#L117-L124\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/migration-utils/blob/master/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/migration/handlers/VersionAbstractionFedoraObjectHandler.java#L117-L124</a></p>\n\n<p>If you believe Fedora \"versions\" should be constructed by a different means than creation-date, maybe we should make a change.</p>\n\n<p>The Brown U object listed in this ticket: <br/>\n<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/awoods/760ee7cbd3f84b56ba517f44aea3116d\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/awoods/760ee7cbd3f84b56ba517f44aea3116d</a></p>",
     "created": "07/Nov/19 5:36 PM",
